			"notes": "- Coffee Berries can now be processed in a thermal expansion sawmill into biomass\n- Bamboo Bundles can now be turned into charcoal and creosote oil in either a thermal expansion redstone furnace with the pyrolysis augment and immersive engineering or railcraft coke ovens\n- All tropical gems can now be used as fuel in a numismatic dynamo from thermal expansion with the lapidary augment\n- Tropical fertilizer can now be used as fuel in a thermal expansion arboreal extractor\n- Reimplemented the Dart Gun, although for now it is just a basic ranged tool, no effect darts for now\n- Whole coconuts are now turned into fruit juice inside a forestry squeezer instead of coconut chunks\n- Now Sifters are rendered like glass and can be used as building blocks, also includes connected textures\n- Bamboo shoots can now grow up to 16 blocks tall\n- Fixed there being a duplicate recipe for creating zirconium\n- Fixed lemons not being assigned to the \"listAllCitrus\" ore dictionary"
		},
